        {
          "id": 1032504042,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I assumed as much. The issue here is, that you cannot use the __attribute__ on windows. Something like mentioned here: https://stackoverflow.com/questions/1537964/visual-c-equivalent-of-gccs-attribute-packed might be put in place instead, but this has to work on Windows, macOS and Linux. Together with a bunch of other plattforms. I am much rather have it now broken and apply a fix soon, than have windows builds being broken for the next few days.",
